  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/04/IMG_7572.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial,helvetica,sans-serif;\">Este domingo ha finalizado la Pascua en Onda, con gran animaci&oacute;n y variedad de actos, incluso una conferencia en el ermitorio del Salvador de Baltasar Torralba Rull sobre la Biograf&iacute;a in&eacute;dita del Can&oacute;nigo Villar.</span></span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalpasquaondaelsalvadorconfebaltasartorralbacanongevillar/img_7560.jpg\" alt=\"img_7560\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalpasquaondaelsalvadorconfebaltasartorralbacanongevillar/img_7561.jpg\" alt=\"img_7561\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalpasquaondaelsalvadorconfebaltasartorralbacanongevillar/img_7562.jpg\" alt=\"img_7562\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalpasquaondaelsalvadorconfebaltasartorralbacanongevillar/img_7563.jpg\" alt=\"img_7563\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalpasquaondaelsalvadorconfebaltasartorralbacanongevillar/img_7564.jpg\" alt=\"img_7564\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalpasquaondaelsalvadorconfebaltasartorralbacanongevillar/img_7565.jpg\" alt=\"img_7565\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/finalpasquaondaelsalvadorconfebaltasartorralbacanongevillar/img_7566.jpg\" alt=\"img_7566\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e